; Customers inferred from payees (plans/37-startup-metrics.md).
;
; The recurring accounts are tagged, but no posting carries `customer:`. Each
; invoice has exactly one recurring posting, no deferred-revenue leg and a
; receivable leg, so its payee (the description before `|`) names the
; customer. The month-end recognition entry has a deferred-revenue leg, so it
; must NOT become a customer: it stays unattributed.
;
; Expect: customer metrics available through payee inference,
; `inferred_customers = true`, and the recognition entry unattributed
; ($50 of each month's MRR).

